    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d362">

                <pb facs="0733" n="623" xml:id="pg623"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ryan to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-12-11"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 11, 1889</date>.
                        (Received December 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 186.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring you to my No. 184 of the 7th
                    instant, I have the honor to inclose note (copy and translation) from Mr.
                    Mariscal advising this legation that he had requested additional information in
                    the case of Captain Stilphen of the schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Robert
                        Ruff</hi>.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thos. Ryan.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d362-a1.xml" xpointer="d362-a1"/>
